WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Choose the approved workspace
Check the tenant name before working. Switching workspace changes the
tenant context while your vendor identity stays the same.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Maintain your products
Products holds your offers in this workspace. Variants, prices, images
and publication determine what customers can buy.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Find the orders waiting on you
Open orders is a current snapshot. Go to orders to inspect your items
and permitted fulfillment transitions, even when sales today are zero.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Follow earnings and invoices
Earnings leads to commission, settlement and payout information. An
order being paid does not mean your payout has reached its destination.

